{
 "spec": "command-conventions-2026-11-05",
 "comparison_rule": "Each case types the listed lines into the command line on a 1x1 quad (points 0,1 selected unless the description says otherwise). SETPOS = Set Position (args axis, value, workPlane, worldSpace), SETPART = Set Part (name), FLIP = Flip Polygons, SETTING = set or query (?) one tool setting, SELMODE = selection-mode toggle. Compare results and points. SETPOS-MISSPELLED = the Set Position name with one letter added.",
